%S A088895 1,2,2,4,41,2104,1387915,229780525655,423295092640509075089
%N A088895 Number of intersecting T_0-antichains on a labeled n-set.
%C A088895 An antichain on a set is a T_0-antichain if for every two distinct pointsf the set there exists a member of the antichain containing one but not the other point.
%F A088895 a(n) = Sum_{k=0..n} Stirling1(n,k)*A001206(k+1). - _Vladeta Jovovic_, Sep 08 2026
%Y A088895 Cf. A001206, A048994, A051185, A059083.
